{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_producercontroller", "label": "ProducerController", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/delivery/producer-controller.mdx", "rationale": "Vergibt seq 1, 2, 3 ..., sendet via wrapped tell an den Consumer, haelt jede Nachricht im Buffer bis zum Ack und retransmittiert nach resendTimeout. Jeder ProducerController ist 1:1 mit einem ConsumerController; Fan-out braucht mehrere Producer oder einen eigenen Router.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_producercontrolleroptionstype", "label": "ProducerControllerOptionsType<T>", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/delivery/producer-controller.mdx", "rationale": "consumer (Pflicht), resendTimeout (Default 500), windowSize (Default 16), producerId (auto-generiert, aber fuer persistierte Producer sollte er stabil sein, damit die Recovery zusammenpasst).", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_windowsize", "label": "windowSize (Flow-Control-Fenster)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/delivery/producer-controller.mdx", "rationale": "Jenseits von N unacked Nachrichten werden eingehende Sends gequeued \u2014 der tell des Aufrufers gelingt, das tatsaechliche Senden pausiert. Es gibt KEIN Signal zurueck an den Aufrufer: reliable-delivery.send ist fire-and-forget, der Producer antwortet nicht darauf. Echte Backpressure entsteht erst, wenn man die Sends gegen die confirm-Callbacks taktet.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_retransmission", "label": "Retransmission mit derselben seq", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/delivery/producer-controller.mdx", "rationale": "Bleibt der Ack aus, wird alle resendTimeout ms erneut gesendet, bis der Ack kommt oder der Producer stoppt; die Wiederholung traegt dieselbe seq, damit der Consumer deduplizieren kann.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_in_memory_buffer", "label": "Der Producer-Buffer ist in-memory und lokal", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/delivery/producer-controller.mdx", "rationale": "Ohne Persistenz gehen unackte Nachrichten beim Crash verloren und der Versand startet wieder bei seq 1; mit einem PersistentActor-Wrapper baut die Recovery Buffer und last-acked-seq wieder auf. Der Buffer liegt lokal beim Producer, also kostet ein Producer-Host-Crash genau diese Nachrichten.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_producercontroller", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_producercontrolleroptionstype", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/delivery/producer-controller.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_producercontrolleroptionstype", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_windowsize", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/delivery/producer-controller.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_producercontroller", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_retransmission", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/delivery/producer-controller.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_windowsize", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_ack_semantics_confirmation_callback", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/delivery/producer-controller.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_in_memory_buffer", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_producercontroller", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/delivery/producer-controller.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_retransmission", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_consumer_controller_duplicate_handling", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/delivery/producer-controller.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_producercontroller", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_consumer_controller_consumercontroller", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/delivery/producer-controller.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_delivery_producer_controller_windowsize", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_typed_behaviors_withstash", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/delivery/producer-controller.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}